__pycache__/
# sunset-reviewed: 2.6 -- The standalone generated .pyc probe is ignored by this suffix rule and becomes visible when the rule is removed. Evidence: tasks/evidence/CLEAN-2026-10-03/renew-ignore.txt (RENEW-10)
*.pyc
# sunset-reviewed: 2.6 -- The generated .pytest_cache probe is ignored by this directory rule and becomes visible when the rule is removed. Evidence: tasks/evidence/CLEAN-2026-10-03/renew-ignore.txt (RENEW-11)
.pytest_cache/
